// The "open session" idiom: a negated LEFT operand expresses "has not happened
// since". Because `!` binds tighter than `since`, `!A since within W B`
// negates only A. Permit Access only if a completed grant was observed for
// this user and resource within the last hour, with no completed revocation
// observed since.
@id("access_not_revoked_since_grant")
permit (
    principal,
    action == Drupe::Action::"Access",
    resource
)
when temporal {
    !Drupe::Action::"Revoke"::response{ input.user: context.input.user, input.resource: context.input.resource }
    since within 1h
    Drupe::Action::"Grant"::response{ input.user: context.input.user, input.resource: context.input.resource }
};
